==Battleground==
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[LeMurr]] spawns.
**5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use Midranged units like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to deal with supporting enemies. For Sunny Celeboodle, she can be taken out with Tanker/Longranged units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], midrange units can still be used for chip damage despite being outranged.

